    "turn_text": "You know, they're not perfect for these international groups. Sometimes they actually impede trade, maybe called World Trade Organization, but sometimes they put on environmental stipulations. Sometimes they put on labor stipulations. Sometimes they say to a country, well, you're trading unfairly because your taxes are too low. You need to increase your income tax on people because it's not fair or your corporate tax because it's not fair. So I'm not a huge fan of these international trade organizations. I voted for most of the trade treaties and groupings these multilateral things because trade is so. Without a question good, but doesn't mean that these organizations come without faults and Personally, we'd be better off just setting either low or no tariffs and just be done with it and not sign up for all the extras because the labor unions get involved with these trade treaties so do the environmentalists and in the end sometimes I think it puts advanced countries like ours that a disadvantage to some other countries and",
